            <description><![CDATA[<p>DITT can now keep itself up to date.</p>
<ul>
<li>Check for updates from Settings → Updates.</li>
<li>Daily background checks let you know when an update is available.</li>
<li>Choose automatic downloads and installation when DITT quits, or install each update yourself.</li>
<li>Update screens use DITT’s familiar design. Current checks get time to finish before a requested restart.</li>
</ul>
<p>Requires macOS 14 or later. Existing users need to install this version manually once to enable future in-app updates.</p>
]]></description>
